      "summaryZh": "Hugging Face 推出了 FFASR 排行榜，这是一个用于评估自动语音识别（ASR）模型在真实世界场景中性能的新基准。该排行榜旨在提供更贴近实际应用的评估指标，帮助开发者选择最适合其需求的 ASR 模型。",
      "summaryEn": "Hugging Face has introduced the FFASR Leaderboard, a new benchmark for evaluating automatic speech recognition (ASR) models in real-world scenarios. The leaderboard aims to provide more practical evaluation metrics to help developers choose the most suitable ASR model for their needs.",
